<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets Taiwan financial shr basket warrant.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets Taiwan financial shr basket warrant.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it issued eight million American-style call warrants on a basket of Taiwan financial stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> National Securities Co  0.9533 shares</p>
<p> Dashin Securities Co    1.0877 shares</p>
<p> Yuanta Securities Co    0.6699 shares</p>
<p> Capital Securities Corp 0.9471 shares</p>
<p> Fubon Securities Co     0.9390 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PRICE  US$9.00     PREMIUM	 20 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     US$0.30     GEARING	 3.33 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE	21.JAN.97   PAY DATE	20.FEB.97</p>
<p> MATURITY	  21.JAN.98   MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  US$10.00    LISTING	 LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p>    NOTE	   CASH SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
